       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLSUB.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT SUB-FILE ASSIGN TO SUBDD
                  ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  SUB-FILE RECORDING MODE IS F.
       01  SUB-REC  PIC X(80).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-MSG   PIC X(80).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-MSG.
           OPEN OUTPUT SUB-FILE.
           MOVE LK-MSG TO SUB-REC.
           WRITE SUB-REC.
           CLOSE SUB-FILE.
           GOBACK.
